{
  "Description": "The plain texts Lambek reads to learn words on its own (tools/Learn-LambekWords.ps1, step 4.6 of the roadmap), downloaded and checked by tools/Get-LambekCorpus.ps1 into a folder of their own, never into the repository: only what Lambek learned from them is kept (engine/Lambek/Data/Forms/<language>.learned.gz). Sha256 is the file as it was when the shipped notebooks were learned: a source that changed since (Tatoeba and Common Voice grow every week) is read all the same, and the notebook learned from it differs. Judges are what the notebook is measured on before it is written (treebanks it never learned from, and the conjugations of UniMorph): a figure that falls refuses it.",
